  "description": "The main character, who has a very bad life in real life, experiences a 180-degree shift in his circumstances after entering the virtual world of Bitworld. Manjae was actually paying a hefty price even if he was glad to have become the strongest and to have gained a lot of fame and fortune thanks to his unexpected weapon. What will happen to the protagonist in that compulsive struggle between power and guilt… Which decision will he make? \n\n(Source: Kakao Webtoon, translated)",
